# Start Stackable project & repositories

## Release roadmap

Product issues organized by targeted release live on the Stackable Release Roadmap:
https://github.com/orgs/gambitph/projects/2/views/1

Theme-only work is tracked on this repo's issues: https://github.com/gambitph/Start-Stackable/issues

## Repositories

### This theme

- Theme repo: https://github.com/gambitph/Start-Stackable
- Block theme shell and `theme.json` token layer for Site Kits.
- Must remain a complete WordPress.org block theme with Stackable inactive.

### Companion plugin (sibling)

- Free plugin: https://github.com/gambitph/Stackable (local checkout: `../Stackable`)
- Premium plugin code: https://github.com/bfintal/Stackable-Premium (lives under the plugin's `pro__premium_only/`, not in this theme)
- Plugin owns blocks, Global Design System, Design Library, and Site Kit import.

## Boundaries

- Do not put plugin features in this theme (custom blocks, shortcodes, CPTs, demo/Site Kit import, Design Library copies, Global Color Scheme UIs).
- There is no free/premium split in this theme zip.
- If a Site Kit needs new header or footer behaviour, add the primitive here and extend the shell contract in the same change.
